MAINTAINER NOTE (delete this block after completing the step below):
Before the first public release, append the verbatim official legal code to
this file so the full license text travels with offline copies:

    curl -L https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode.txt >> LICENSE

Then delete this note block. The notice above is legally sufficient (the
license is incorporated by reference), but shipping the full text is best
practice for datasets that will be redistributed offline.
